  "description": "JIMGEV crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C106 H112 N12 O40 Yb8,2(C1 H2 Cl2),2(C2 H6 O1). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb1A (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb2A (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb3A (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb4A (Yb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 15 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.436-3.832 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.11-115.49°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C112H122Cl4N12O42Yb8. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
